        "source_level": "B2",
        "word_count": 355,
        "duration_sec": null,
        "body_text": "A seven-year-old boy has been rescued from the rubble of a residential building in Dymer, in the Kyiv region, after 14 hours. Overnight Russian strikes on the village killed 11 people, Ukrainian officials have said. The attack occurred in the early hours of Sunday.",
        "audio_url": null,
        "description": null,
        "license": "proprietary",
